"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 10; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nHollis Mbeki (hollis-mbeki, Central team lead) wrote in a direct message with assistant on 2026-10-21 09:00: I need to escalate a Tansley Parcel problem today. Who should I call?\n```","id":10,"source":"hollis-mbeki, a direct message with assistant, 2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 1; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nHollis Mbeki (hollis-mbeki, Central team lead) wrote in a direct message with assistant on 2026-10-14 09:00: For future reference, no action needed: my go-to person at Tansley Parcel for escalations on the Marlowe rollout is Idris Brevik from now on. Please remember that for me.\n```","id":1,"source":"hollis-mbeki, a direct message with assistant, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 6; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in a direct message with hollis-mbeki on 2026-10-16 17:00: I replied to Hollis in your DM: noted that Soren Tolland is the go-to escalation contact at Tansleigh Packaging for the Bittern rollout, and that it stays between us. I didn't save anything separately, since the brain already saves this DM as a fact only Hollis can see.\n```","id":6,"source":"assistant, a direct message with hollis-mbeki, 2026-10-16T17:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"hollis-mbeki"}
